  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Working group meetings for reviewing the Kenyan Energy Policy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity supports the Ministry of Energy to review the energy policy together with the relevant stakeholders and a tram of (international) experts. Aim of the reviewing proces is to include innovations in renewable energy and clean technologies and to draft a new energy policy which will address energy access challenges as well as opportunities for public-private partnerships, promotion of innovations, private sector develpment and job creation. Workshops were organised for teams of stakeholders and experts with focus on different sub-sectors such as solar energy, wind energy, green hydrogen as well as clean cooking and energy efficiency.</narrative>
  </description>
